# Paquet apk local de vigie. Construit par image/build-apk.sh (abuild, clé image/keys/).
# pkgver est injecté par l'environnement (VIGIE_PKGVER), la version complète est dans le binaire.
pkgname=vigie
pkgver=${VIGIE_PKGVER:-0.0.0}
pkgrel=0
pkgdesc="vigie - appliance de bench datastore NFS pour vSphere"
url="https://localhost/vigie"
arch="x86_64"
license="proprietary"
depends="openrc busybox"
options="!check !strip"
source=""

package() {
	install -Dm755 "$startdir"/vigie "$pkgdir"/usr/bin/vigie
	install -Dm755 "$startdir"/init.sh "$pkgdir"/usr/lib/vigie/init
	install -Dm755 "$startdir"/update-issue.sh "$pkgdir"/usr/lib/vigie/update-issue
	install -Dm755 "$startdir"/console-login.sh "$pkgdir"/usr/lib/vigie/console-login
	install -Dm644 "$startdir"/fonts/lat2-terminus16.psfu "$pkgdir"/usr/share/vigie/fonts/lat2-terminus16.psfu
	install -Dm644 "$startdir"/fonts/default8x16.psfu "$pkgdir"/usr/share/vigie/fonts/default8x16.psfu
	install -Dm755 "$startdir"/vigie.initd "$pkgdir"/etc/init.d/vigie
	install -Dm755 "$startdir"/vigie-init.initd "$pkgdir"/etc/init.d/vigie-init
	install -Dm755 "$startdir"/vigie-issue.initd "$pkgdir"/etc/init.d/vigie-issue
	install -Dm755 "$startdir"/vigie-live.initd "$pkgdir"/etc/init.d/vigie-live
	install -Dm755 "$startdir"/vigie-cloud.initd "$pkgdir"/etc/init.d/vigie-cloud
	install -Dm755 "$startdir"/udhcpc-hook.sh "$pkgdir"/etc/udhcpc/post-bound.d/vigie
	install -Dm755 "$startdir"/udhcpc-hook.sh "$pkgdir"/etc/udhcpc/post-renew.d/vigie
}
